WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Checkout slows as the day goes on

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Every cart request adds a snapshot

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Expired sessions remain reachable

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
More retained memory means more risk

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Correlate traces, JFR and heap dumps

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Bound cache size and lifetime

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Validate customer latency and live heap
